(7674357, 1253840, 86447, '<td valign="top">I saw that you were asking about this image on the threads.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote, but to me... this doesn''t fit as well as the highest scoring images because I was expecting the ENTIRE image to be all on the same plane visually.<br/> <br/>You''ve isolated two together quite well, but I think the voters wanted the whole image to be visually compressed.<br/> <br/>But, take my opinion with a grain of salt.  I scored poorly.  :D<br/></td>', 'I saw that you were asking about this image on the threads. I didn''t vote, but to me... this doesn''t fit as well as the highest scoring images because I was expecting the ENTIRE image to be all on the same plane visually. You''ve isolated two together quite well, but I think the voters wanted the whole image to be visually compressed. But, take my opinion with a grain of salt.  I scored poorly.  :D', '2020-09-10 19:20:27.000000', NULL, 0),
